    "ruleType": "core-ability",
    "group": "Core",
    "summary": "When pre-battle abilities are resolved, a unit whose models all have **Scouts X\"** can do one of these:\n\n- If it is in **[Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)**, set it up anywhere wholly within your own deployment zone.\n- If it is wholly within your own deployment zone, the unit can carry out a **[Scout move](vsdata:core-rule/scout-move)** (rule 24.32).\n- If it is embarked in a **DEDICATED TRANSPORT** wholly within your own deployment zone and every model aboard has Scouts, the **DEDICATED TRANSPORT** carrying it can carry out a **[Scout move](vsdata:core-rule/scout-move)**.",
